eight:100%;opacity:0;transition:opacity .35s ease}\n.pf-film[data-painted=\"true\"] .pf-film__canvas{opacity:1}\n.pf-film__title{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px;pointer-events:none;will-change:opacity,transform}\n.pf-film__title h2{margin:0;color:#f5f5f7;font-family:inherit;font-size:clamp(48px,6vw,100px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.05;text-align:center;text-transform:none;text-shadow:0 2px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.18)}\n@media(max-width:749px){.pf-film{height:540vh;height:540svh}.pf-film__title h2{font-size:clamp(36px,9vw,64px);white-space:nowrap}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.pf-film{height:100vh;height:100svh}.pf-film__title{will-change:auto}.pf-film__canvas{transition:none}}\n</style>\n<script>\n(()=>{\n  const root=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling.previousElementSibling;\n  if(!root||!root.matches('[data-pf-film]')||root.dataset.initialized)return;\n  root.dataset.initialized='true';\n  const stage=root.querySelector('.pf-film__stage'),canvas=root.querySelector('canvas'),title=root.querySelector('.pf-film__title');\n  const ctx=canvas.getContext('2d',{alpha:false});if(!ctx)return;\n  const mobileQuery=matchMedia('(max-width:749px)'),motion=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce)');\n  const cache=new Map(),pending=new Map(),failures=new Map();\n  let urls=[],mobile=false,generation=0,queue=[],active=0,raf=0,dead=false,near=false;\n  let target=0,current=0,wanted=0,drawn=-1,lastTime=0,lastQueued=-1,direction=1,bytes=0;\n  const clamp=x=>Math.max(0,Math.min(1,x));\n  function wake(){if(!dead&&!raf&&!document.hidden)raf=requestAnimationFrame(tick)}\n  function trim(){\n    const budget=mobile?64*1024*1024:112*1024*1024;\n    const entries=[...cache].sort((a,b)=>Math.abs(b[0]-wanted)-Math.abs(a[0]-wanted));\n    for(const [index,item] of entries){\n      if(bytes<=budget&&cache.size<=36)break;\n      if(index===drawn||index===wanted)continue;\n      cache.delete(index);bytes-=item.bytes;\n    }\n  }\n  function schedule(){\n    if(!near||dead)return;\n    const indices=[wanted];\n    if(!motion.matches){for(let d=1;d<=20;d++){indices.push(wanted+d*direction);if(d<=8)indices.push(wanted-d*direction)}}\n    queue=[...new Set(indices)].filter(i=>i>=0&&i<urls.length&&!cache.has(i)&&!pending.has(i)&&(failures.get(i)||0)<2);\n    pump();\n  }\n  function pump(){\n    while(!dead&&near&&active<(mobile?3:4)&&queue.length){\n      const i=queue.shift();if(cache.has(i)||pending.has(i))continue;\n      const image=new Image(),token=generation;active++;pending.set(i,image);image.decoding='async';\n      image.onload=async()=>{\n        try{await image.decode()}catch(e){}\n        if(dead||token!==generation)return;\n        active--;pending.delete(i);\n        const size=image.naturalWidth*image.naturalHeight*4;\n        cache.set(i,{image,bytes:size});bytes+=size;trim();wake();pump();\n      };\n      image.onerror=()=>{\n        if(dead||token!==generation)return;\n        active--;pending.delete(i);failures.set(i,(failures.get(i)||0)+1);\n        if(failures.get(i)<2)queue.push(i);\n        pump();\n      };\n      image.src=urls[i];\n    }\n  }\n  function paint(){\n    let index=wanted;\n    if(!cache.has(index)){\n      let distance=Infinity;\n      for(const key of cache.keys()){const d=Math.abs(key-wanted);if(d<distance){distance=d;index=key}}\n      // Keep the last valid frame while the exact requested frame arrives.\n      if(drawn>=0&&Math.abs(drawn-wanted)<=distance)return;\n    }\n    const item=cache.get(index);if(!item||index===drawn)return;\n    const image=item.image,scale=Math.max(canvas.width/image.naturalWidth,canvas.height/image.naturalHeight);\n    const w=image.naturalWidth*scale,h=image.naturalHeight*scale;\n    ctx.drawImage(image,(canvas.width-w)/2,(canvas.height-h)/2,w,h);\n    drawn=index;root.dataset.painted='true';root.dataset.frame=String(index+1);\n  }\n  function measure(){\n    const rect=root.getBoundingClientRect(),height=stage.clientHeight;\n    const next=motion.matches?0:clamp(-rect.top/Math.max(1,root.offsetHeight-height));\n    if(Math.abs(next-target)>.00001)direction=next>=target?1:-1;\n    target=next;\n    // Text follows physical scrolling immediately, independent of image buffering.\n    const fade=motion.matches?0:clamp(-rect.top/(height*.55));\n    title.style.opacity=String(1-fade);\n    title.style.transform=`translate3d(0,${-fade*height*.18}px,0)`;\n  }\n  function tick(time){\n    raf=0;if(dead)return;measure();\n    const dt=Math.min(50,lastTime?time-lastTime:16.7);lastTime=time;\n    current+= (target-current)*(1-Math.exp(-dt/85));\n    if(Math.abs(target-current)<.00012)current=target;\n    wanted=motion.matches?0:Math.round(current*(urls.length-1));\n    if(wanted!==lastQueued){lastQueued=wanted;schedule()}\n    paint();\n    if(near&&current!==target)wake();\n  }\n  function resize(){\n    if(mobile!==mobileQuery.matches){select();return}\n    const box=stage.getBoundingClientRect(),ratio=Math.min(devicePixelRatio||1,mobile?1.5:1.25);\n    const width=Math.max(1,Math.round(box.width*ratio)),height=Math.max(1,Math.round(box.height*ratio));\n    if(canvas.width!==width||canvas.height!==height){canvas.width=width;canvas.height=height;drawn=-1}\n    wake();\n  }\n  function select(){\n    generation++;for(const image of pending.values()){image.onload=null;image.onerror=null;image.src=''}\n    pending.clear();cache.clear();failures.clear();bytes=0;active=0;queue=[];drawn=-1;lastQueued=-1;\n    mobile=mobileQuery.matches;urls=JSON.parse(root.querySelector(mobile?'[data-pf-mobile]':'[data-pf-desktop]').textContent);\n    root.dataset.sequence=mobile?'mobile':'desktop';measure();current=target;wanted=Math.round(current*(urls.length-1));\n    resize();schedule();\n  }\n  function visibility(){if(!document.hidden){lastTime=0;wake();schedule()}}\n  function destroy(event){\n    if(event&&!event.target.contains(root))return;\n    dead=true;generation++;cancelAnimationFrame(raf);observer.disconnect();ro.disconnect();\n    window.removeEventListener('scroll',wake);window.removeEventListener('resize',resize);\n    document.removeEventListener('visibilitychange',visibility);document.removeEventListener('shopify:section:unload',destroy);\n    motion.removeEventListener('change',select);mobileQuery.removeEventListener('change',select);\n    for(const image of pending.values()){image.onload=null;image.onerror=null;image.src=''}cache.clear();pending.clear();\n  }\n  const observer=new IntersectionObserver(entries=>{\n    near=entries[0].isIntersecting;\n    if(near){lastTime=0;measure();schedule();wake()}else queue=[];\n  },{rootMargin:'700px 0px'});\n  const ro=new ResizeObserver(resize);\n  select();observer.observe(root);ro.observe(stage);\n  window.addEventListener('scroll',wake,{passive:true});window.addEventListener('resize',resize,{passive:true});\n  document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',visibility);document.addEventListener('shopify:section:unload',destroy);\n  motion.addEventListener('change',select);mobileQuery.addEventListener('change',select);\n})();\n</script>",
